; The import ledger: beangulp's target and duplicate-detection source.
;
; It includes the journal — the real transactions beangulp appends to — and
; deliberately NOT `pending.bean`: a pending placeholder carries the same
; account, amount and date as the transaction it is waiting for, so beangulp
; would treat the real one as already imported. It also excludes
; `schedules.bean`, which the ledger does not include either.
;
; `main.bean` (Fava) includes this file, so entries appended here are seen.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

include "journal.bean"
